  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:380px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-black pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Carbon Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/f/fc/Gajeel_Redfox_Carbon_Absorption.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20210309064938\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Gajeel Redfox Carbon Absorption\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/f/fc/Gajeel_Redfox_Carbon_Absorption.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20210309064938\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/f/fc/Gajeel_Redfox_Carbon_Absorption.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20210309064938 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/f/fc/Gajeel_Redfox_Carbon_Absorption.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20210309064938 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Gajeel Redfox Carbon Absorption\" width=\"270\" height=\"231\" data-image-key=\"Gajeel_Redfox_Carbon_Absorption.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Gajeel Redfox Carbon Absorption.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Gajeel Redfox (Fairy Tail) absorbing carbon in the water to turn his iron into steel.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb carbon.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>absorb and utilize carbon in some way</b>. Technique of <a href=\"/wiki/Carbon_Manipulation\" title=\"Carbon Manipulation\">Carbon Manipulation</a>. Variation of  <a href=\"/wiki/Organic_Absorption\" title=\"Organic Absorption\">Organic Absorption</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FCarbon_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Carbon Assimilation</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FCarbon_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb carbon, while removing it from the source, into their body and use it in various ways, gaining some form of advantage, either by enhancing themselves, gaining the drained power, using it as power source etc., either temporarily or permanently.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FCarbon_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilation_Shield\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Assimilation Shield\">Assimilation Shield</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Organic_Breath\" title=\"Organic Breath\">Carbon Breath</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Periodic_Element_Empowerment\" title=\"Periodic Element Empowerment\">Periodic Element Empowerment</a> using carbon.\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Enhanced_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Enhanced Condition\">Enhanced Condition</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Supernatural_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Supernatural Condition\">Supernatural Condition</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Organic_Regeneration\" title=\"Organic Regeneration\">Organic Regeneration</a> using carbon.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a> (limited to carbon-based powers)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FCarbon_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Carbon_Manipulation\" title=\"Carbon Manipulation\">Carbon Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Healing_Earth\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Healing Earth\">Healing Earth</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Organic_Absorption\" title=\"Organic Absorption\">Organic Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Periodic_Table_Powers\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Periodic Table Powers\">Periodic Table Powers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Reforming\" title=\"Reforming\">Reforming</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FCarbon_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Can't absorb self-generated carbon.</li>\n<li>May be limited to how much one can absorb.</li>\n<li>May have limited range, including touch only.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absorption Immunity\">Absorption Immunity</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FCarbon_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Gajeel Redfox (<i>Fairy Tail</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://scp-int.wikidot.com/scp-042-cs\">SCP-042-CZ - A Formerly Winged Horse</a> (<i>SCP Foundation</i>)</li>\n<li>Chad Tylor (<i>Superpowereds</i>)</li>\n<li>Nanobots (<i>The Powerpuff Girls</i>)</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260802061224\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.024 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 106/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 89/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 125/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    8.626      1 Template:Infobox\n100.00%    8.626      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_powerlisting:pcache:idhash:424601-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260802061224 and revision id 2811497. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
